     OVERVIEW OF THE OPTIONS IN THE DRIVE WINDOW
 
     NOTE:  Press <Tab> to toggle between the logical unit window
            and the drive window.
 
     Use the drive window to perform the following tasks:
 
          - Add a drive
          - Delete a drive
          - Fail a drive
          - Reconstruct the data on a drive in a RAID 1, 3, or 5
            logical unit
          - Format a drive (any RAID level)
          - View the drive statuses in ace
